__pycache__/
# Personal Claude Code config stays out of the repo, but the shared agent
# artifacts underneath it are versioned deliberately -- see
# .claude/skills/README.md and .claude/memory/README.md. Git will not descend
# into an excluded directory, so the directory itself has to be re-included
# before anything inside it can be. .claude/hooks/ is versioned for a stronger
# reason than the rest: settings.json registers the hook in it, and a
# registration pointing at a file the repository does not ship is a permission
# check that silently does not run.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/memory/
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/checkpoint.md
.venv/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
unit-coverage/
e2e-coverage/
maintenance-audit-coverage/
homebrew-release-coverage/
shell-coverage/
